{"text":"孝昌二年四月廿八日，清信王為亡夫寧遠將軍□□□□男洛，〔為〕父母、師僧、法界眾生，敬造彌勒尊像一區。願同津□□□□。","tags":[{"name":"Office","term":"寧遠將軍","refId":null,"text":"寧遠將軍","start":16,"end":20},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"法界","refId":null,"text":"法界","start":36,"end":38},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"眾生","start":38,"end":40},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":43,"end":45}]}